# Compiled simulation FASTAs and the intermediates they come from: ~122 MB total, and fully
# reproducible from `raw/combingym/compile_combingym.py` + `../dataset_preprocessor.py`. The source
# xlsx landscapes are gitignored too (raw/combingym/.gitignore), so committing derived data whose
# source is untracked would be worse than not committing either.
#
# Note this differs from datasets/screening/, where the *_max2000.fasta files ARE committed — there
# the raw sources are tracked and small.
combingym_*.fasta
raw/combingym_*.fasta
flip2_*.fasta
raw/flip2_*.fasta
